      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ja! Tienes cara de defenderte bastante bien en\nlos combates, ¡justo lo que andábamos buscando!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nosotros también somos muy fuertes!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIdeamos un método de combate, y desde\nentonces no hemos perdido ni una sola vez.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El secreto de nuestra fuerza reside en...\n¡los movimientos de estado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020007300650063007200650074006F0020006400650020006E00750065007300740072006100200066007500650072007A0061002000720065007300690064006500200065006E002E002E002E000A00A1006C006F00730020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F0073002000640065002000650073007400610064006F002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Con ellos, hacemos que nuestros Pokémon\nse vuelvan más fuertes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E00200065006C006C006F0073002C00200068006100630065006D006F007300200071007500650020006E00750065007300740072006F007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A007300650020007600750065006C00760061006E0020006D00E1007300200066007500650072007400650073002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y también ayudan a infligir problemas de estado\na los de nuestros adversarios!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No te puedes enfocar solo en atacar! ¡Así no\nson los combates, y te lo vamos a demostrar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a hacerte morder el polvo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061002000680061006300650072007400650020006D006F007200640065007200200065006C00200070006F006C0076006F002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si eres lo suficientemente ton... digooo, valiente\npara luchar contra nuestros movimientos de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nestado, aquí te esperamos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres combatir, prepárate y ven a hablar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D00620061007400690072002C0020007000720065007000E1007200610074006500200079002000760065006E002000610020006800610062006C00610072002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y? ¿Qué pasó? ¿List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para la paliz... digooo,\nel combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0059003F002000BF0051007500E9002000700061007300F3003F002000BF004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002000700061007200610020006C0061002000700061006C0069007A002E002E002E0020006400690067006F006F006F002C000A0065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estamos acostumbrados a esperar. Al fin y\nal cabo, usar movimientos de estado implica<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncomienzos de combate algo más lentos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mis Pokémon usan movimientos de estado que\nhacen que aumenten sus características!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya vas a ver, cuanto más se alargue el combate,\nmás acorralados quedarán tus Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Estamos teniendo una buena racha, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!\n¡Es hora de actualizar nuestro récord!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pfff... ¡Se acabó nuestra racha!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006600660066002E002E002E002000A1005300650020006100630061006200F30020006E007500650073007400720061002000720061006300680061002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nada de eso! ¡Si gana uno de los dos, no cuenta\ncomo derrota!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006100640061002000640065002000650073006F0021002000A100530069002000670061006E006100200075006E006F0020006400650020006C006F007300200064006F0073002C0020006E006F0020006300750065006E00740061000A0063006F006D006F00200064006500720072006F00740061002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así que ahora me toca a mí! ¡No pienso permitir\nque nos rompas la racha!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si gano yo, mantendremos la racha!\n¡Vamos, que no tengo todo el día!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530069002000670061006E006F00200079006F002C0020006D0061006E00740065006E006400720065006D006F00730020006C00610020007200610063006800610021000A00A100560061006D006F0073002C00200071007500650020006E006F002000740065006E0067006F00200074006F0064006F00200065006C0020006400ED0061002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, vaya, ¿le tienes miedo a mis movimientos\nde estado? Con razón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C00200076006100790061002C002000BF006C00650020007400690065006E006500730020006D006900650064006F002000610020006D006900730020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F0073000A00640065002000650073007400610064006F003F00200043006F006E002000720061007A00F3006E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mi especialidad son los movimientos de estado\nque reducen las características del adversario!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te vas a dar cuenta que tus tácticas habituales\nno son tan efectivas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Somos una unidad inseparable! ¡No admitiremos\nla derrota a menos que nos ganes a ambos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No puede ser... ¡nuestros movimientos de estado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007000750065006400650020007300650072002E002E002E002000A1006E00750065007300740072006F00730020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F0073002000640065002000650073007400610064006F002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A pesar de que fortalecí a mis Pokémon con ellos\ny todo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000700065007300610072002000640065002000710075006500200066006F007200740061006C0065006300ED002000610020006D0069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200063006F006E00200065006C006C006F0073000A007900200074006F0064006F002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y de que reduje la fuerza de los suyos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000640065002000710075006500200072006500640075006A00650020006C006100200066007500650072007A00610020006400650020006C006F00730020007300750079006F0073002E002E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y no fue suficiente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100590020006E006F002000660075006500200073007500660069006300690065006E00740065002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Danos un consejo. ¿Qué es lo más importante\npara ganar combates?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006E006F007300200075006E00200063006F006E00730065006A006F002E002000BF0051007500E90020006500730020006C006F0020006D00E1007300200069006D0070006F007200740061006E00740065000A0070006100720061002000670061006E0061007200200063006F006D00620061007400650073003F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creer en tus Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007200650065007200200065006E002000740075007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entrenar a tus Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E007400720065006E0061007200200061002000740075007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin duda, tienes razón...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069006E00200064007500640061002C0020007400690065006E00650073002000720061007A00F3006E002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los movimientos de estado ayudan, pero al final\nno son la clave de la victoria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias por el consejo! La verdad es que\nlos combates Pokémon son todo un mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me alegro de haber combatido contra ti!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006500200061006C006500670072006F00200064006500200068006100620065007200200063006F006D00620061007400690064006F00200063006F006E007400720061002000740069002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias por el consejo! La verdad es que\nlos combates Pokémon son todo un mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me alegro de haber combatido contra ti!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
